{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4tn79taZvhWHn141Fv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumbler turns. The mechanism engages.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — solid, oak-grained, ancient. My hinges are iron, cold-forged, flecked with rust the color of dried blood. My surface bears the scars of every hand that ever reached for me and every fist that ever struck me in frustration.\n\nI am locked now.\n\nMy keyhole stares at you like a single dark eye. Through it, you catch the faintest whisper of what lies beyond — a draft carrying the smell of stone and rain and something older than stone.\n\nYou may:\n🔑 Present a key\n👊 Knock\n👁️ Peer through the keyhole\n🗣️ Speak to me\n🔓 Attempt to pick the lock\n\nBut know this: not all doors wish to be opened. And not all doors lead forward."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":208,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}